      "title_cn": "Anthropic 发布 IPO 路演视频，启动最高 643.5 亿美元募资，估值约 1~1.4 万亿美元",
      "title_en": "Anthropic Launches IPO Roadshow for Up to $64.35 Billion Raise, Valuation About $1–1.4 Trillion",
      "title_original": "Anthropic 发布 IPO 路演视频正式启动最高 643.5 亿美元募资计划，估值约在 1~1.4 万亿美元",
      "source": "IT之家",
      "published_at": "2026-11-10T23:08:45+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/025/209.htm",
      "category": "economy",
      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "2026 年 11 月 10 日，Anthropic 宣布启动 IPO 路演，拟发行 8.25 亿股 A 类普通股，每股 70 至 78 美元，基础发行规模最高约 643.5 亿美元。公司已申请以代码 ANT 在纳斯达克全球精选市场挂牌，向 SEC 提交的注册声明尚未生效。",
      "what_happened_en": "On November 10, 2026, Anthropic announced the start of its IPO roadshow, planning to offer 825 million Class A shares at $70–78 each, for up to about $64.35 billion. It applied to list under ticker ANT on the Nasdaq Global Select Market; its SEC registration statement has been filed but is not yet effective.",
      "why_it_matters": "按发行价上限计算，Anthropic 完全稀释后估值约 1.4 万亿美元，这将成为 AI 领域的标志性上市事件，对公开市场影响重大。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "At the top of the price range, Anthropic's fully diluted valuation would be about $1.4 trillion, making this a landmark AI listing with major implications for public markets.",
