      "title_cn": "英伟达向 CNCF 捐赠 OpenShell 并新增 AI 工厂平台组件",
      "title_en": "NVIDIA Donates OpenShell to CNCF and Adds AI Factory Platform Components",
      "title_original": "NVIDIA Expands Open Source Commitment With OpenShell Donation and New AI Infrastructure",
      "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-11-10T16:00:03+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/open-source-openshell-infrastructure/",
      "category": "chips",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "在 KubeCon + CloudNativeCon 上，英伟达将用于保障和治理自主智能体的开源运行时 OpenShell 捐赠给 CNCF，并以沙箱项目身份加入。英伟达还公布了 NVIDIA DSX AI 工厂平台的新组件，包括 NVIDIA Kubernetes Engine。",
      "what_happened_en": "At KubeCon + CloudNativeCon, NVIDIA contributed OpenShell, an open source runtime for securing and governing autonomous agents, to the CNCF, where it enters as a Sandbox project. NVIDIA also announced new components of the NVIDIA DSX AI Factory Platform, including NVIDIA Kubernetes Engine.",
      "why_it_matters": "将智能体安全工具交由 CNCF 治理，使将其集成到产品中的组织能够参与塑造，这对在 Kubernetes 上部署自主智能体的团队具有意义。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "Placing agent security tooling under CNCF governance lets the organizations building it into products shape it, which matters for teams deploying autonomous agents on Kubernetes.",
